        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-j0syfklx5tj",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "The two-day Paracas–Nazca trip is optional. Its price and how it fits with your return from La Paz are confirmed separately."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:ae91988616d800bb",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "91c2c1713ab4d55cfafd8071528a07f4f1774e48efc5730ef3350420af6c21ee",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-j0syfklx5tj",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "The trip to Vinicunca takes place at around 5,200 m above sea level and requires good physical stamina."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:c0ea3dbe423e2c87",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "eb9aa10220dc75f834ea5fb62cfc87cfd51fbb863a9d2d63ee4fa3fe3fa6425b",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-j0syfklx5tj",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "The mirror effect on the Uyuni Salt Flats depends on the season and weather. Access to Incahuasi and other parts of the salt flats is confirmed for your chosen date."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:5763d97399897262",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "37848d452ae3b1b939d33415ea3c0b13e61f6bcdbde847c0c178913056756301",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-j0syfklx5tj",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "The La Paz to Lima flight is charged separately. International flights are agreed when you book."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:3743c029d2e28b0d",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e0a5df2e2e1aefdd6a911dcf1b060e41c1a09a790213f8bd055c8339f8e566eb",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-j0syfklx5tj",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "For the 3-star package, the rate table lists Sol Plaza in Puno, while the daily itinerary lists the 4-star Casona Plaza. Your hotel in Puno is confirmed before payment."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:59350ce14fe6a173",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "363379cef4ebe74364d003c7dc7644a605f39514efb7721ddf1d8b6ca23236b6",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-j0syfklx5tj",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "The hotel in Ojo de Perdiz, accommodation after Day 11 and the order of transfers for the Uyuni to La Paz flight are confirmed before payment."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:50dcbcf4cf1dd333",
